#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.desktop.in
msgid "Go Analysis Board"
msgstr "围棋分析棋盘"

#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.desktop.in
#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Analyse, review and play Go with KataGo"
msgstr "使用 KataGo 分析、复盘和对弈围棋"

#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.desktop.in
msgid "Go;Baduk;Weiqi;KataGo;SGF;"
msgstr "Go;Baduk;Weiqi;KataGo;SGF;围棋;棋盘;棋谱;复盘;对弈;"

#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "A Go board that drives the KataGo engine for live analysis, SGF review and editing, and games against the computer. KataGo can run on the same machine or on another one on your network."
msgstr "一块驱动 KataGo 引擎的围棋棋盘，用于实时分析、SGF 复盘与编辑，以及与电脑对弈。KataGo 可以运行在同一台机器上，也可以运行在你网络中的另一台机器上。"

#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Live analysis with candidate moves, win rate, score lead and ownership"
msgstr "实时分析：候选手、胜率、目差和地盘"

#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Game review with a win-rate graph and a move tree"
msgstr "复盘：胜率图和棋谱树"

#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Games against KataGo"
msgstr "与 KataGo 对弈"

#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "SGF editing, and game records downloaded from Fox"
msgstr "SGF 编辑，以及从野狐下载的棋谱"

#: data/io.github.zhaob1n.Mirai.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "mirai does not include KataGo or a network; supply your own."
msgstr "mirai 不附带 KataGo 或神经网络，请自行准备。"
